WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:05.010
Hey everyone! I'm Jun Man,
the creator of PawConnect.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:09.480
I started PawConnect with a simple idea:
to make life with our pets easier, smarter,

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.430
and more connected. PawConnect brings
everything together in one place,

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.790
from managing your pet's health records,
vaccinations, vet visits, and milestones,

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.250
to capturing special moments and
connecting with other pet lovers.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:27.790
We've also got a social feed, Zoomie,
PawAI, our AI-powered pet companion,

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.890
and features to help you discover nearby
pet services and products through PawShop.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.710
And the best part? We're
just getting started.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.350
My vision is to make PawConnect
more than just another pet app,

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.410
but a place where every pet owner
feels connected and supported.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:48.190
Welcome to PawConnect. Let's make
every moment with our pets count!
